        "title": "style(android): apply ktlint to landed changes",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nAndroid ktlint fails on `main` after the recently landed streaming replay harness (#100200), chat command controls (#98796), and adjacent Android changes. The failure blocks otherwise unrelated mobile PRs, including the offline-cache stack.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nApply the repository's current ktlint formatting mechanically to every Android source and test file reported by `:app:ktlintCheck`, then regenerate the native-app i18n source inventory affected by those formatted strings. No runtime behavior changes.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo product behavior change. Android validation is green again, so mobile fixes can land against a trustworthy baseline.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Blacksmith Testbox `tbx_01kwrvdak8yxww01vn1mx8mg7s`: `cd apps/android && ./gradlew :app:ktlintCheck :app:testPlayDebugUnitTest` — green.\n- `node --import tsx scripts/native-app-i18n.ts check` — green after regenerating `apps/.i18n/native-source.json`.\n- `git diff --check` — green.\n\nFollow-up to #100200 and #98796.\n",
